Calendar Modal

isAdmin check gates the "Add Holiday" and "Delete" buttons — correct role-based UI.
alert() is used for error feedback (alert(res.error || 'Failed to save holiday')) — native browser alert is jarring, breaks the design system, and is not accessible in the same way as the toast system used elsewhere.
